msgstr "对于 AC 公式，可用的方法有："

msgid "``DRPAI-AC`` dRPA calculation (see Refs. [1] and [4])."
msgstr "``DRPAI-AC`` dRPA 计算（参见文献 [1] 和 [4]）。"

msgid ""
"``DRPAII-AC`` dRPA calculation, using antisymmetrized two-electron integrals"
