msgstr "``DRPAII-AC`` dRPA 计算，使用反对称化双电子积分（参见文献 [1] 和 [4]）。"

msgid "``RPAXI-AC`` RPAx calculation (see Refs. [1] and [5])."
msgstr "``RPAXI-AC`` RPAx 计算（参见文献 [1] 和 [5]）。"

msgid ""
"``RPAXII-AC`` RPAx calculation, using antisymmetrized two-electron integrals"
" (see Refs. [1] and [5])."
msgstr "``RPAXII-AC`` RPAx 计算，使用反对称化双电子积分（参见文献 [1] 和 [5]）。"

msgid ""
"``DRPAI-AC-ALT`` dRPA calculation using an alternative derivation (see Ref. "
"[7])."
msgstr "``DRPAI-AC-ALT`` 使用替代推导的 dRPA 计算（参见文献 [7]）。"

