"called the “alternative plasmon formula”, see Ref. [1])."
msgstr ""
"``RPAXII-AC-NOINT`` 不沿绝热连接积分的 RPAx 计算（使用“动能”和“势能”贡献，有时称为“替代等离激元公式”，参见文献 "
"[1]）。"

msgid "For the DIEL formulation, the available methods are:"
msgstr "对于 DIEL 表述，可用的方法有："

msgid "``DRPAI-DIEL`` dRPA calculation (see Ref. [2])."
msgstr "``DRPAI-DIEL`` dRPA 计算（参见文献 [2]）。"

msgid "``DRPAIIA-DIEL`` dRPA-IIa approximation (see Ref. [2])."
msgstr "``DRPAIIA-DIEL`` dRPA-IIa 近似（参见文献 [2]）。"

msgid "``RPAXIA-DIEL`` RPAx-Ia approximation (see Ref. [2])."
msgstr "``RPAXIA-DIEL`` RPAx-Ia 近似（参见文献 [2]）。"

msgid "For the RCCD formulation, the available methods are:"
msgstr "对于 RCCD 表述，可用的方法有："

msgid "``DRPAI-RCCD`` dRPA-I calculation (see Ref. [3])."
msgstr "``DRPAI-RCCD`` dRPA-I 计算（参见文献 [3]）。"

msgid ""
"``RPAXII-RCCD`` RPAx-II calculation (Szabo-Ostlund variant 1 is calculated "
