msgid ""
"All of the different codes are capable to perform standard RPA correlation "
"energy calculations, but have distinct features which separate them from "
"each other. More details about each program's capabilities can be found in "
"the respective subsections."
msgstr "所有不同的代码都能够执行标准的 RPA 相关能计算，但各自具有将其彼此区分开的独特特征。关于每个程序功能的更多细节可在各小节中找到。"

msgid ""
"Electron correlation energies within the random-phase approximation can be "
"calculated by the programs **DIRPA**, **RPAX2** and **ACFDT** that are "
"subdirectives of the driver command **KSRPA**. These methods should be used "
"in conjunction with Kohn-Sham reference determinants, i.e., orbitals and "
"orbital energies from a preceeding DFT calculation should be supplied. An "
"alternative implementation of various RPA electron correlation methods by "
"Julien Toulouse and co-workers is described in the subsection `Random-phase "
"approximation (RPATDDFT) program <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#random-phase-approximation-rpatddft-program>`__. "
"The second alternative implementation of RPA is based on the adiabatic-"
"connection fluctuation-dissipation and is described in the subsection `RIRPA"
" program <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#rirpa-program>`__. This "
"implementation additionally allows calculations with σ-functionals, which at"
" negligible computational cost significantly improves over RPA in the "
"calculation of various chemical properties."
msgstr ""
"随机相位近似下的电子相关能可由驱动程序命令 **KSRPA** 的子指令 **DIRPA**\\ 、\\ **RPAX2** 和 **ACFDT** "
"计算。这些方法应与 Kohn-Sham 参考行列式结合使用，即应提供来自先前 DFT 计算的轨道和轨道能量。Julien Toulouse "
"及其合作者对各种 RPA 电子相关方法的另一种实现描述于小节 `Random-phase approximation (RPATDDFT) "
"program <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#random-phase-"
"approximation-rpatddft-program>`__ 中。RPA 的第二种替代实现基于绝热连接涨落耗散，描述于小节 `RIRPA "
"program <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#rirpa-program>`__ "
"中。该实现还允许使用 σ-泛函进行计算，其计算代价可忽略不计，在计算各种化学性质方面显著优于 RPA。"

msgid ""
"**RPA:** :math:`[1]` F. Furche, `Phys. Rev. B "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.64.195120>`__ **64**, 195120 (2001). "
"**RPAX2:** :math:`[2]` A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.85.012517>`__ **85**, 012517 (2012). "
":math:`[3]` A. Heßelmann, Top. Curr. Chem. **365** 97 (2015) "
"**ACFDT(ALDA):** :math:`[4]` A. Heßelmann and A. Görling, `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct4007212>`__ **9**, 4382 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"**RPA:** :math:`[1]` F. Furche, `Phys. Rev. B "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.64.195120>`__ **64**, 195120 (2001). "
"**RPAX2:** :math:`[2]` A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.85.012517>`__ **85**, 012517 (2012). "
":math:`[3]` A. Heßelmann, Top. Curr. Chem. **365** 97 (2015) "
"**ACFDT(ALDA):** :math:`[4]` A. Heßelmann and A. Görling, `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct4007212>`__ **9**, 4382 (2013)."

msgid ""
"**DIR** if set to DIR\\ :math:`\\ne`\\ 0 this enables a direct RPA "
"calculation (default ’0’)"
msgstr "**DIR** 若设为 DIR\\ :math:`\\ne`\\ 0，则启用直接 RPA 计算（默认值为 ’0’）"

msgid ""
"**MEM** if set to MEM\\ :math:`\\ne`\\ 0 the 3-index Coulomb integrals and "
"the amplitudes are kept in memory (default: 0)"
msgstr "**MEM** 若设为 MEM\\ :math:`\\ne`\\ 0，则将 3 索引库仑积分和振幅保留在内存中（默认值：0）"

msgid ""
"For applying the correction as described in Ref. [4], the values of ``SCAL``"
" and ``MU`` have to be set to the values ``SCAL=0.6`` and ``MU=2d0``."
msgstr ""
"为应用如参考文献 [4] 中所述的校正，必须将 ``SCAL`` 和 ``MU`` 的值设置为 ``SCAL=0.6`` 和 ``MU=2d0``\\ "
"。"

msgid ""
"The random-phase approximation program (``rpatddft``) can be used to "
"calculate RPA correlation energies after a SCF calculation. Additionally, it"
" can be used to calculate dynamic dipole polarizabilities, C\\ :math:`_6` "
"dispersion coefficients, and excitation energies. The program currently "
"works without point-group symmetry."
msgstr ""
"随机相位近似程序（\\ ``rpatddft``\\ ）可用于在 SCF 计算后计算 RPA 相关能。此外，它还可用于计算动态偶极极化率、C\\ "
":math:`_6` 色散系数和激发能。该程序目前不支持点群对称性。"

msgid "``ECORR, <list of methods>``"
msgstr "``ECORR, <list of methods>``"

msgid "Calculation of RPA correlation energies [1] (see options below)"
msgstr "计算 RPA 相关能 [1]（见下方选项）"

msgid "``PROPERTIES, <list of methods>``"
msgstr "``PROPERTIES, <list of methods>``"

msgid ""
"Calculation of dynamic dipole polarizabilities and C\\ :math:`_6` dispersion"
" coefficients [10] (see options below)"
msgstr "计算动态偶极极化率和 C\\ :math:`_6` 色散系数 [10]（见下方选项）"

msgid "``EXCIT, <list of methods>``"
msgstr "``EXCIT, <list of methods>``"

msgid "Calculation of excitation energies [11] (see options below)"
msgstr "计算激发能 [11]（见下方选项）"

msgid "``INTAC,NLAMBDA=<n>[,LAMBDA=<lambda>,WEIGHT=<weight>]``"
msgstr "``INTAC,NLAMBDA=<n>[,LAMBDA=<lambda>,WEIGHT=<weight>]``"

msgid ""
"Number of quadrature points for the Gauss-Legendre numerical integration "
"along the adiabatic connection for RPA calculations (default is 7). If "
"``LAMBDA`` and ``WEIGHT`` are given, assumes a one-point quadrature with "
"given abscissa and weight."
msgstr ""
"用于 RPA 计算中沿绝热连接的 Gauss-Legendre 数值积分的积分点数目（默认为 7）。若给定了 ``LAMBDA`` 和 "
"``WEIGHT``\\ ，则假定为具有给定横坐标和权重的单点求积。"

msgid "``INTFREQ,METHFREQ=<methfrq>,NFREQ=<nfreq>``"
msgstr "``INTFREQ,METHFREQ=<methfrq>,NFREQ=<nfreq>``"

msgid ""
"Options for the numerical integration over the frequency variable of RPA "
"calculations. ``METHFREQ`` governs the type of quadrature used (0(default) "
"is Gauss-Chebyshev, 1 and 2 are Gauss-Legendre, 3 is Clenshaw-Curtis) and "
"``NFREQ`` governs the number of quadrature points (default is 16)."
msgstr ""
"RPA 计算中对频率变量进行数值积分的选项。\\ ``METHFREQ`` 控制所用求积的类型（0（默认）为 Gauss-Chebyshev，1 和 2"
" 为 Gauss-Legendre，3 为 Clenshaw-Curtis），\\ ``NFREQ`` 控制积分点数目（默认为 16）。"

msgid "``DFTKERNEL,<funcx>[,<funcc>]``"
msgstr "``DFTKERNEL,<funcx>[,<funcc>]``"

msgid ""
"Specify the exchange and correlation kernel for ``EXCIT`` (if only one "
"argument is given, it is understood to be the exchange-correlation kernel)."
msgstr "为 ``EXCIT`` 指定交换与关联核（若只给出一个参数，则将其理解为交换-关联核）。"

msgid ""
"``NOSPINBLOCK`` For spin-unrestricted calculations, use a formalism where "
"matrices are of "
":math:`\\alpha\\alpha+\\alpha\\beta+\\beta\\alpha+\\beta\\beta` dimensions "
"(the default is to use a formalism with a nospinflip/spinflip block "
"structure)"
msgstr ""
"``NOSPINBLOCK`` 对于自旋非限制计算，使用矩阵维度为 "
":math:`\\alpha\\alpha+\\alpha\\beta+\\beta\\alpha+\\beta\\beta` 的形式（默认使用具有 "
"nonspinflip/spinflip 块结构的形式）"

msgid ""
"``PRINT_INT,<nbr>`` Level of print of integrals (AO,MO,Orbitals,...), from 0"
" to 4."
msgstr "``PRINT_INT,<nbr>`` 积分（AO、MO、Orbitals 等）的打印级别，从 0 到 4。"

msgid ""
"Calculation of RPA correlation energies ``ECORR, <list of methods>`` If no "
"method is given, a ``SO2-RCCD`` calculation will be done (see below)."
msgstr ""
"计算 RPA 相关能 ``ECORR, <list of methods>`` 若未给出方法，则将执行 ``SO2-RCCD`` 计算（见下文）。"

msgid ""
"Calculation of properties, excitation energies and oscillator strengths "
"``EXCIT, METHOD=<method>`` The ``EXCIT`` calculations output shows the "
"excitation energies in au, eV and nm, the oscillator strengths in length and"
