"Below is an example input file for spin-restricted calculations for the "
"hydrogen molecule. Note that the input record from a preceding calculation "
"is mandatory for initialization of orbitals and eigenvalues as starting "
"point for RPA calculation, whereas it can come from HF or DFT calculations "
